  "caption": "The stress results describe the registered protocols rather than validate the final H-soft model out of domain. R-log pooled RMSE is 5.7805, 5.1796 and 6.5035 under element, target and X-leave evaluation, respectively. Screening EF is shown separately for R-log and S-eps, with equal weight per evaluation where EF is defined. Valid EF counts are 5/5, 3/3 and 29/35; six zero-positive X-leave evaluations remain undefined. The table includes all-evaluation budgets of 100, 60 and 700 selections; the defined-EF budgets are 100, 60 and 580. N/M sums are evaluation exposures, including repeated compositions in element tests. Different populations, prevalences and budgets prevent an ease ranking from cross-protocol EF magnitudes. These are protocol-level evidence, not final-model results.",
